# Push a change to this file to run a backtest without the GitHub connector.
# Format: one line, "MODE [MONTHS]". Lines starting with # are ignored.
# The mode must also be in the fetch-step whitelist in backtest.yml, or it will
# silently get the short-history fetcher (see the v78bt note in CLAUDE.md).
#
# v80bt on the CALIBRATED simulator (v61.1). The previous five v80bt runs were
# all measured on a broken engine and their rows mean nothing. Now the shared
# module reproduces the documented +0.0469R to four decimals, so PART A (does
# the deployed config pass 6 windows on dollars), PART B (does ROTA starve
# DONCH4H) and PART C (do the caps reject the stronger signals) finally count.
v80bt 36
